# Precompiled x64 dependency .lib files ARE committed so the repo builds out of the box
# (matching how the 32-bit libs were tracked). Exceptions kept out of git:
#   - cryptlib-Debug.lib (158 MB) / cryptlib-Release.lib (42 MB) : large Crypto++ static
#     libs. Rebuild from Lead-Extern/lib/README.md, or pull via Git LFS.
#   - DLLs / PDBs / export libs : runtime/debug artifacts, not needed to build.
cryptlib-Debug.lib
cryptlib-Release.lib
*.dll
*.pdb
*.exp
